    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "msgctxt": "523680",
      "tipo": "unk_op1659",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF.",
      "pt": "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "msgctxt": "523736",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF.",
      "pt": "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "msgctxt": "523820",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game.",
      "pt": "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "msgctxt": "523900",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving.",
      "pt": "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "msgctxt": "523968",
      "tipo": "unk_op1653",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Would you like to save your Clear Data?",
      "pt": "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "msgctxt": "524008",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "Are you sure you wish to exit",
      "pt": "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "msgctxt": "524040",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "without saving the Clear Data?",
      "pt": "sem salvar os Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "msgctxt": "524072",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "……you hear…… open your eyes, Prae……\nYou're sleepi…… you'll…… fade awa……",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "msgctxt": "524156",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Don't be deceiv…… your mind…… Master!\nThis…… a trap…… to ensnare you……",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "msgctxt": "524240",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "No…… pen your eyes…… my Darling……!\nIf you keep…… falling……\nYou won't ever…… up again!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "msgctxt": "524340",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Pain suddenly rushes through my left hand.\nWondering why, I check the back of it……",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "msgctxt": "524428",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I don't remember seeing it before.\nI wonder if I hurt myself somewhere……?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "msgctxt": "524504",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I don't remember seeing it before.\nI wonder if I hurt myself somewhere……?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "msgctxt": "524580",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The pain soon subsided.\nMaybe it was just a dizzy spell.\nI take a deep breath and pull myself together.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "msgctxt": "524684",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…it's just,\nI feel like I heard an extremely familiar voice.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "msgctxt": "524748",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The pain soon subsided.\nMy left hand is working fine, so maybe I just got a bit dizzy.\nI take a deep breath, pull myself together,\nand move on ahead.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "msgctxt": "524900",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This is the main gate.\nIf I leave through here, I can go home.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "msgctxt": "524964",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But there's still something bothering me.\nI should go see #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF in the garden.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "msgctxt": "525068",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The Archery Club is holding morning practice.\nIt's almost time for class,\nso they're in the middle of cleaning up.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "msgctxt": "525184",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The Archery Club is practicing on the range.\nSeeing the club members concentrating on their targets,\nit'd be awkward for an outsider like me to disturb them.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "msgctxt": "525344",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It's the school's back gate.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "msgctxt": "525376",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I've heard that students who're late\nsneak into the building through here.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "msgctxt": "525452",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But classes haven't started yet,\nso there's no one like that here.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "msgctxt": "525520",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It's the school's back gate.\nIt's always closed.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "msgctxt": "525572",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I remember hearing students who live nearby\nsay that if they could get through here,\nthey could sleep in for five more minutes.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "msgctxt": "525700",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It's the side entrance.\nIf I want to enter the school,\nI should use the #C000246204main entrance#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "msgctxt": "525804",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It seems like I can't get into school from here.\nThe door is locked.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "msgctxt": "525876",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Past here is the gymnasium.\nI should #C000246204head into the school building#CDEF\nand attend homeroom first.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "msgctxt": "525988",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This door leads to the gymnasium.\nBut there's no reason to go there.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "msgctxt": "526060",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "\"Recruiting members!\"",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "msgctxt": "526084",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "There's a drawing of a cute girl in a lion costume.\nYou can tell it's a poster for the kendo club\nfrom how she's holding what looks\nlike a bamboo sword in her right hand.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "msgctxt": "526256",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Various drinks are lined up inside the vending machine.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "msgctxt": "526312",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…unfortunately, I don't have any change on me.\nI'll pass for now.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "msgctxt": "526380",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#[He][She]# shoots!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "msgctxt": "526400",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The ball hit the net with a thump, slowly rolled back,\nand eventually returned to its original position.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "msgctxt": "526508",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#[He][She]# shoots!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "msgctxt": "526528",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "――――Or I would have, but even if I wanted to,\nI can't really kick the ball while wearing a skirt.\nSo, I settled for an enthusiastic yell.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "msgctxt": "526672",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Maybe they used it during gym class\nand then just left it here……",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "msgctxt": "526740",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This is the stand for morning assemblies.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "msgctxt": "526784",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It's infamous for placing the curse of lengthy speeches\nupon anyone who climbs on it.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "msgctxt": "526872",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Oh, sorry, it's nothing.\nI was just a little dizzy. I'm alright now.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "msgctxt": "526944",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I feel like I'm not actually myself……\nThere's no way that's……",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "msgctxt": "527012",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Some students are saying that they've tried\nto leave via the school gate,\nbut they always end up turning back around.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "msgctxt": "527132",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "No way that's true, right?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "msgctxt": "527160",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Hey hey, let's drop by the station today\nbefore going home.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "msgctxt": "527220",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Ahh, I can't wait for classes to end.\nI wanna hang out with you already.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "msgctxt": "527296",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I know! Since we're going anyway,\nwhy don't we go now? Let's just skip school!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "msgctxt": "527376",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Ah…… c-come on, I was just joking!\nAhaha…… a joke, just a joke……\nI was just messing around a bit……",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "msgctxt": "527484",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I left the volleyball club because I have\nexams this year. Now I've gained weight……",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "msgctxt": "527572",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Around here, see?\nIt's embarrassing for a disciplinarian,\nisn't it? But……",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "msgctxt": "527648",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "My main thread doesn't have \"self-training\"\nin it…… which means I keep putting on weight.\nIsn't this some kind of fatal bug?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "msgctxt": "527776",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Or maybe it's harassment? What if God\ndecided that I get to be the chubby girl now?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "msgctxt": "527860",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Oh, here you are.\nI've got a message from the Editor in Chief.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "msgctxt": "527924",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "She wants to talk, so go see her after school.\nNo wonder you're the Newspaper Club's ace―\nyou're expected to do big things.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "msgctxt": "528052",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I've delivered the message.\nDon't blame me if you forget later.",
      "pt": ""
    }
  ]
}
